@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Backups and the quarterly restore drill
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "On-call person" as actor
box "Frontend — Zamaro Web (Angular)" #E0F2FE
  participant "Zamaro Web in the\nfresh environment" as web
end box
box "Backend — Zamaro API (Laravel HTTP layer)" #D1FADF
  participant "Zamaro API in the\nfresh environment" as api
end box
box "Backend — Zamaro Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Production database" as db
  database "Backup storage\n(Canadian region, AES-256)" as backup
  participant "Hosting platform" as hosting
  database "Restored database" as restored
end box

== Continuous backup ==
db -> backup : Daily base backup (schedule <TO SUPPLY>)
loop continuously
  db -> backup : Archive WAL segments, at most every <TO SUPPLY> minutes (<= 15, L2-091)
end
backup -> backup : Expire base backups and WAL older than 14 days (L2-091)

== Quarterly restore drill ==
actor -> hosting : Start drill; pick a target time within the last 14 days
hosting -> backup : Fetch nearest base backup and WAL to the target time
backup --> hosting : Files
hosting -> restored : Restore and replay WAL to the target time (L2-091)
actor -> api : Deploy current release pointing at the restored database
api -> restored : php artisan migrate:status matches the release
api --> actor : /health/ready returns 200
actor -> web : Smoke test /, /artists/{slug}, a booking detail
web -> api : Page data
api -> restored : Queries
restored --> api : Rows
api --> web : Data
web --> actor : Pages render with data from the target time
actor -> actor : Record start, target time, completion, duration and outcome\nin RestoreDrillRecord (location <TO SUPPLY>); target 4 hours (L2-091)
actor -> hosting : Tear down the fresh environment
@enduml
